        {
          "key": "note",
          "text": "Unarmored AC 10 + proficiency + Dex is on the AC effect. In a Taijutsu stance: the Unarmed die d6 (the stance), d8 at 7th, d10 at 13th, d12 at 19th, and Taijutsu cost a fixed Special cost by cast rank (D 3, C 5, B 9, A 14, S 20; a jutsu whose cost is already Special keeps its own; no reductions) are on the effects."
        },
        {
          "key": "note",
          "text": "At the table: the same benefits while wielding a weapon you're proficient with (not in a stance); Strength or Dexterity for unarmed strikes, Taijutsu and Martial Arts (set your Taijutsu ability); one unarmed attack as a Bonus Action. Choose a Taijutsu stance and its Expertise."
        }
      ]
